            {
                "entry_id": "bf88c12c-c31e-3f01-9d28-480fcccde40b",
                "word": "taverne",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "c0eced27-309c-4554-bbdc-0ae98ad273b7",
                        "entry_id": "bf88c12c-c31e-3f01-9d28-480fcccde40b",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "tavernes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7aeafb30-ae86-3dca-8dcd-09f8916d3afe",
                        "entry_id": "bf88c12c-c31e-3f01-9d28-480fcccde40b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Cabaret, lieu où l’on sert à boire."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "833d699c-f532-4f86-acbb-28a7caa5c11e",
                                "sense_id": "7aeafb30-ae86-3dca-8dcd-09f8916d3afe",
                                "text": "Le peu qui restaient, confirmés par enquête généalogique, s'étaient cloîtrés en des tavernes où buvaient à tire-larigot en attendant la fin du monde."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ce929e7a-d50b-4646-8192-484a34f2f2ff",
                                "sense_id": "7aeafb30-ae86-3dca-8dcd-09f8916d3afe",
                                "text": "La taverne était grande et accueillante ; boiseries et rideaux de dentelle, parfums d’andouille chaude et de rost er forn, bière pression au bar, non, ma grande, rappelle-toi : tu as décidé de ne plus boire."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "82505f3b-1408-3cc3-a52b-1b21f9be68b9",
                        "entry_id": "bf88c12c-c31e-3f01-9d28-480fcccde40b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Lieu où on sert à boire et qui, jusqu'en 1979, étaient interdits aux femmes."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Québec"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4f5019a6-edf1-4dfd-8e1b-5cb337a28d2f",
                                "sense_id": "82505f3b-1408-3cc3-a52b-1b21f9be68b9",
                                "text": "Les tavernes font partie de l'histoire du Québec et de sa culture populaire. À preuve, le succès sans précédent de la pièce de théâtre Broue."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "908889b7-fdf9-43d7-a4d6-51652c0c50c9",
                        "source_entry_id": "bf88c12c-c31e-3f01-9d28-480fcccde40b",
                        "target_lang_word": "Taverne",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Taverne",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "144f7c95-aae4-3c11-a282-bcd5ebe97c61",
                                        "entry_id": "97584c8c-924b-3499-bfbf-ebdbbf485b80",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "italienische Weinschenke oder italienisches Wirtshaus"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a74c270-2292-4070-93d9-5ff9d8cc40d4",
                                                "sense_id": "144f7c95-aae4-3c11-a282-bcd5ebe97c61",
                                                "text": "Gestern Abend haben wir in einer tollen Taverne meinen Geburtstag gefeiert."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8aaf861d-8ef6-43ae-a32e-45de15df8679",
                                                "sense_id": "144f7c95-aae4-3c11-a282-bcd5ebe97c61",
                                                "text": "„Dass er sich gern als Strichjunge verkleidet in Tavernen herumtrieb und Kamelfersen aß, mag man dem Cäsaren verzeihen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "50abd86c-612a-40e4-80bf-d2985ffe2f35",
                                                "sense_id": "144f7c95-aae4-3c11-a282-bcd5ebe97c61",
                                                "text": "„Nach einiger Zeit wollte er dem Lärm und Geschrei der Hafengegend wirklich entfliehen und mietete seine erste Unterkunft – direkt über einer Taverne.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4ed7e8ca-d5ca-41a4-9447-2ca4c3298af7",
                        "source_entry_id": "bf88c12c-c31e-3f01-9d28-480fcccde40b",
                        "target_lang_word": "tavern",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tavern",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d908740a-0dae-3114-899f-66fff910f105",
                                        "entry_id": "b7c1f76c-1c6f-3139-86d7-e6560696fb73",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A restaurant or bar."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "52a8afc9-48a4-37e1-a5b8-c334cc0e19ce",
                                        "entry_id": "b7c1f76c-1c6f-3139-86d7-e6560696fb73",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A building containing a bar licensed to sell alcoholic drinks, and offering sleeping accommodations for travelers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a43f2f1e-4abf-44fb-8631-8bb4ebd4726a",
                                                "sense_id": "52a8afc9-48a4-37e1-a5b8-c334cc0e19ce",
                                                "text": "I maruell I heare no nevves of Dromio, either hee ſlackes the matter, or betraies his Maiſter, I dare not motion anie thing to Stellio, till I knovv vvhat my boy hath don, Ile hunt him out, if the loiterſacke be gone ſpringing into a Tauerne, Ile fetch him reeling out."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c328dc87-cacf-4c41-b96f-91e021262f3f",
                                                "sense_id": "52a8afc9-48a4-37e1-a5b8-c334cc0e19ce",
                                                "text": "Dreaming when Dawn's Left Hand was in the Sky / I heard a Voice within the Tavern cry, / \"Awake, my Little ones, and fill the Cup / Before Life's Liquor in its Cup be dry.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d37e62d6-f9bb-40e2-b97e-b78a45bf16ad",
                                                "sense_id": "52a8afc9-48a4-37e1-a5b8-c334cc0e19ce",
                                                "text": "At half-past nine on this Saturday evening the parlor of the Salutation Inn, High Holborn, contained most of its customary visitors. […] In former days every tavern of repute kept such a room for the select circle—a club, or society, of habitués, who met every evening for a pipe and a cheerful glass."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3ad9408-028d-4f08-8277-53b7d75b8e5b",
                                                "sense_id": "52a8afc9-48a4-37e1-a5b8-c334cc0e19ce",
                                                "text": "At one of the way-stations on his long journey a barmaid at a tavern speaks to Gilgamesh and tries to give him common sense on the human condition."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
